Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Japanese Union Room chat keyboard
Applies after 0005-port-hooks.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The Japanese ROM's Union Room chat: pages of hiragana, katakana, Latin letters and
digits (the gText_EmptyTextInput* rows), symbols and the registered texts; R gives
the last character its next form from the ROM's table (small and voiced kana, the
other case), with a label for hiragana, katakana or Latin letters. Keys, chat
lines and the text being typed are in the small font, at the ROM's spacing (11-pixel
keyboard rows, 12-pixel chat rows, 12 lines), the page menu has six entries, and a
registered text goes in without a trailing space. tools/localize_japanese.py
stages the table, the Latin page's title and the chat graphics only into a tree
with this patch (it looks for UNION_ROOM_CHAT_KANA).

